      "audioText": "Meanwhile, his wife was waiting outside in the car.",
      "audioMode": "tts",
      "languageCode": "en",
      "patternId": "n6-narrative-precision-5"
    },
    {
      "id": "en.n6.class-05.t04",
      "en": "So there he is at the reunion, and the whole family shouts: Surprise!",
      "es": "Y ahí está él en la reunión, ¡y toda la familia grita: sorpresa!",
      "explanationEs": "Presente histórico para el clímax, igual que en la unidad anterior.",
      "segments": [
        "So there he is at the reunion,",
        "and the whole family shouts: Surprise!"
